WEBVTT

00:00:08.375 --> 00:00:13.175
. hack//Legend of the Twilight

00:00:15.915 --> 00:00:22.945
Tell me nanimo wakaranai no demo
Tell me I don't
understand anything, but

00:00:23.115 --> 00:00:30.115
You say itsumo sonna kotoba mo
You always say those
kinds of words, too

00:00:31.065 --> 00:00:37.865
Surechigau dake no
You find another way
You find another way where
we only pass each other by

00:00:38.305 --> 00:00:44.965
Owatteku sekai wo tobidashite
You know?
And rush out into a world
that's ending, you know?

00:00:45.275 --> 00:00:50.835
Hello Hello It's a New World
Hello, hello, it's a New World!

00:00:51.115 --> 00:00:54.515
Hikari yori hayaku
Faster than light,

00:00:55.285 --> 00:00:59.315
monokuro no supiido de
with monochromatic speed

00:00:59.625 --> 00:01:05.155
Hello Hello It's a New World
Hello, hello, it's a New World!

00:01:05.395 --> 00:01:08.925
Jikan yori tooku
Farther than time,

00:01:09.735 --> 00:01:14.465
kakenukeru You're so far away
I run through it; you're so far away

00:01:30.085 --> 00:01:34.645
Tanabata Night

00:01:59.215 --> 00:01:59.905
Don't run away.

00:02:01.955 --> 00:02:03.145
Here I go!

00:02:16.435 --> 00:02:17.725
You do it!

00:02:26.605 --> 00:02:28.005
You can do it if you try.

00:02:34.185 --> 00:02:35.305
How painful.

00:02:43.425 --> 00:02:44.685
Hey!

00:02:47.525 --> 00:02:48.825
Shugo.

00:02:49.535 --> 00:02:50.655
Rena!

00:02:52.205 --> 00:02:52.895
Recently...

00:02:53.065 --> 00:02:55.405
...all you've been doing
is playing with Sanjuro.

00:02:56.335 --> 00:02:58.365
It's not play, it's training.

00:02:58.775 --> 00:03:01.245
A warrior must first train.

00:03:01.845 --> 00:03:03.675
Shugo's not a warrior!

00:03:05.385 --> 00:03:07.405
I want to become stronger.

00:03:08.285 --> 00:03:09.545
To protect you, Rena.

00:03:18.265 --> 00:03:19.855
It's all right to train...

00:03:20.165 --> 00:03:22.855
...but we need to spend
some time together too.

00:03:34.545 --> 00:03:35.475
Tanabata?

00:03:36.215 --> 00:03:36.765
That's right.

00:03:36.845 --> 00:03:38.245
Tonight, in a special area there will...

00:03:38.445 --> 00:03:40.815
...be a Tanabata Night event!

00:03:41.355 --> 00:03:42.815
What's it like?

00:03:43.485 --> 00:03:45.145
Let's go see!

00:03:45.325 --> 00:03:47.155
But it's Tanabata Night...

00:03:48.755 --> 00:03:50.585
...where the lovers
Orihime and Kengyu...

00:03:50.825 --> 00:03:52.055
...are reunited that one time in a year.

00:03:52.695 --> 00:03:56.095
It's bound to be a
terribly romantic event!

00:03:57.295 --> 00:03:58.635
Romantic?

00:03:59.365 --> 00:04:01.665
What's wrong with being romantic?

00:04:04.945 --> 00:04:06.935
To not understand the romance...

00:04:07.045 --> 00:04:08.705
...of Tanabata Night, what a fool.

00:04:11.385 --> 00:04:12.475
Bonjour.

00:04:13.645 --> 00:04:14.945
Mademoiselle.

00:04:18.455 --> 00:04:20.475
Why don't you leave that...

00:04:20.925 --> 00:04:23.515
...boorish guy and go with me?

00:04:31.505 --> 00:04:32.935
What is your name?

00:04:33.005 --> 00:04:34.965
My name is Komiyan the Third.

00:04:35.375 --> 00:04:36.765
Because of my pride...

00:04:37.105 --> 00:04:39.235
...I am called the King of Aloofness!

00:04:43.545 --> 00:04:46.035
You're Komiyama aren't you?

00:04:48.615 --> 00:04:49.775
Definitely Komiyama.

00:04:50.555 --> 00:04:51.415
Do not speak of the real...

00:04:51.455 --> 00:04:52.755
...world while on the internet!

00:04:53.185 --> 00:04:54.625
Who are you!?

00:04:55.395 --> 00:04:56.825
Shugo Kunisaki.

00:04:57.225 --> 00:04:58.425
An aquaintance?

00:04:58.665 --> 00:05:00.385
Last year, he was in my class.

00:05:00.965 --> 00:05:03.835
That odd laugh gave it away.

00:05:04.265 --> 00:05:07.755
Is it really Komiyama?! I'm Rena!

00:05:08.135 --> 00:05:10.905
Rena? T-The Rena
that transferred out?!

00:05:11.405 --> 00:05:13.375
Yeah. Long time!

00:05:17.115 --> 00:05:18.075
Aaaah!

00:05:18.315 --> 00:05:21.185
Even inside a game, Rena is trés bien!

00:05:23.785 --> 00:05:24.375
What?

00:05:25.125 --> 00:05:27.085
Don't hit on game characters.

00:05:28.095 --> 00:05:28.715
Rena.

00:05:28.795 --> 00:05:30.125
Contact Mireille and the others please.

00:05:30.625 --> 00:05:30.955
Eh?

00:05:32.265 --> 00:05:34.325
I'll sign up for the
Tanabata Night Event too.

00:05:35.395 --> 00:05:35.825
OK!

00:05:56.255 --> 00:05:57.805
Were you in the middle
of maintenance?

00:05:58.155 --> 00:05:59.175
Lord Balmung?

00:05:59.455 --> 00:06:01.475
The event will be starting soon.

00:06:02.125 --> 00:06:05.325
Reki, I'm leaving the event to you.

00:06:06.025 --> 00:06:07.325
Lord Balmung, what about you?

00:06:07.965 --> 00:06:09.765
It's not a bad thing to
occasionally return to...

00:06:10.395 --> 00:06:12.895
...being a normal user
and sign up for the event.

00:06:13.535 --> 00:06:15.165
You just want to play, don't you?

00:06:17.535 --> 00:06:19.135
Did something happen?

00:06:19.875 --> 00:06:21.035
The other day.

00:06:21.445 --> 00:06:23.965
An operator doing maintenance
slipped into a coma.

00:06:24.575 --> 00:06:26.065
That can't possibly be.

00:06:29.585 --> 00:06:30.745
The Twilight.

00:06:33.225 --> 00:06:34.655
It's not possible!

00:06:35.055 --> 00:06:36.855
The system was improved...

00:06:37.155 --> 00:06:38.995
...so that such an event
could never happen again!

00:06:39.495 --> 00:06:42.825
But, the system is still
not completely error free.

00:06:44.165 --> 00:06:45.565
When we receive information
about disturbances...

00:06:46.165 --> 00:06:49.035
...we should be acting on them.

00:06:50.075 --> 00:06:51.365
Lord Balmung...

00:06:52.105 --> 00:06:53.335
A perfect version of "The World"...

00:06:54.005 --> 00:06:55.375
...might well be impossible.

00:07:02.655 --> 00:07:03.845
Sorry to keep you waiting!

00:07:04.415 --> 00:07:06.715
Oh! A yukata!

00:07:08.555 --> 00:07:12.395
Mireille's prized secret rare item!

00:07:14.465 --> 00:07:15.485
Sorry to keep you waiting!

00:07:16.495 --> 00:07:17.795
Everyone's in a yukata!

00:07:17.965 --> 00:07:21.165
Mireille, what's so rare
about your yukata?

00:07:21.605 --> 00:07:24.075
I got it from a major battle!

00:07:24.275 --> 00:07:26.035
It's different from everyone else's!

00:07:26.605 --> 00:07:28.075
Is that so?

00:07:28.215 --> 00:07:29.305
Shugo.

00:07:35.485 --> 00:07:36.645
Does this suit me?

00:07:37.985 --> 00:07:39.815
Y-yeah...

00:07:40.955 --> 00:07:42.485
I'm relieved!

00:07:44.455 --> 00:07:47.725
How about me? Does this suit me?

00:07:49.365 --> 00:07:50.995
Y-yes.

00:07:51.635 --> 00:07:54.325
OK! Step apart, step apart.

00:07:54.705 --> 00:07:59.165
Well then, let's go to
"Distant Azure River"!

00:08:10.615 --> 00:08:12.675
What are we doing?

00:08:13.125 --> 00:08:15.925
It's the Tanabata Night festival!

00:08:15.925 --> 00:08:16.825
Eh?

00:08:16.895 --> 00:08:19.825
You write a wish and
dangle it from the bamboo.

00:08:20.025 --> 00:08:20.825
It's said that...

00:08:21.025 --> 00:08:23.085
...your wish will come
true if you do so.

00:08:23.365 --> 00:08:24.995
Oh, how wonderful.

00:08:32.475 --> 00:08:35.375
I want rare items. - Mireille

00:08:35.475 --> 00:08:38.345
I want my Grunty to
grow up strong. - Hotaru

00:08:38.485 --> 00:08:38.885
Give me worthy enemies. - Ohka

00:08:38.885 --> 00:08:40.145
All right!
Give me worthy enemies. - Ohka

00:08:40.145 --> 00:08:41.305
Give me worthy enemies. - Ohka

00:08:51.465 --> 00:08:53.485
Don't! It's a secret!

00:09:04.775 --> 00:09:06.575
I've been waiting, Rena.

00:09:07.045 --> 00:09:09.205
So you are here, Komiyama!

00:09:09.475 --> 00:09:12.375
What, Kunisaki? You're here too?

00:09:12.515 --> 00:09:13.315
Of course!

00:09:13.745 --> 00:09:15.305
You think I'd leave...

00:09:15.655 --> 00:09:17.205
...Rena alone with
someone like you around!

00:09:18.325 --> 00:09:18.955
Aquaintance?

00:09:18.955 --> 00:09:19.475
Yeah.

00:09:20.225 --> 00:09:21.425
An old classmate.

00:09:21.425 --> 00:09:24.015
Oh dear, you're with friends?

00:09:24.755 --> 00:09:25.885
But their existence...

00:09:26.125 --> 00:09:29.615
...is solely to enhance Rena's beauty.

00:09:36.275 --> 00:09:40.135
I want Rena's socks.
- Komiyan the Third

00:09:40.805 --> 00:09:42.175
I'll delete him!

00:09:48.515 --> 00:09:49.675
All participants...

00:09:49.915 --> 00:09:52.645
...please gather around
the special stage.

00:09:54.125 --> 00:09:57.425
Everyone, welcome to
"Azure Distant River"!

00:09:57.655 --> 00:09:59.785
This is the start of the
Festival of the Tanabata...

00:10:00.225 --> 00:10:03.995
...Night Event "Orihime
Contest Battle Royale"!

00:10:06.265 --> 00:10:09.965
In short it's the
"Tanabata de Tanabota".

00:10:10.405 --> 00:10:13.235
Wow, what a wonderful title.

00:10:13.505 --> 00:10:15.475
What a really old-fashioned joke.

00:10:16.075 --> 00:10:17.945
I think so to.

00:10:18.985 --> 00:10:21.415
To not understand this style...

00:10:21.885 --> 00:10:24.285
To start off, one player will...

00:10:24.385 --> 00:10:26.685
...be chosen to serve as "Orihime".

00:10:26.985 --> 00:10:28.715
After overcoming a number of trials...

00:10:28.895 --> 00:10:31.915
...the one that reaches
"Orihime", is the winner.

00:10:32.295 --> 00:10:33.695
The winner, can have their wish they...

00:10:33.925 --> 00:10:38.025
...wrote earlier on
the paper come true.

00:10:39.305 --> 00:10:40.595
Seriously?!

00:10:45.645 --> 00:10:47.365
Rena.

00:10:48.675 --> 00:10:49.315
However...

00:10:49.315 --> 00:10:53.145
...if the wish cannot be
fulfilled within "The World"...

00:10:53.445 --> 00:10:56.475
...a one-year subscription
will be given instead.

00:10:58.015 --> 00:10:59.985
Is everyone ready?!

00:11:00.685 --> 00:11:03.485
Orihime's is... this person!

00:11:11.865 --> 00:11:12.385
Rena!

00:11:12.805 --> 00:11:13.425
What?!

00:11:16.935 --> 00:11:19.565
Now, Orihime! Your name?

00:11:20.675 --> 00:11:22.765
Uh...

00:11:24.715 --> 00:11:27.075
Rena, I'm fourteen!

00:11:27.345 --> 00:11:29.745
Pleased to meet you!

00:11:32.085 --> 00:11:34.715
The selection of Orihime
should have been random.

00:11:35.595 --> 00:11:39.855
Yet, that girl was selected.
Is this coincidence?

00:11:41.095 --> 00:11:41.655
Rena!

00:11:42.195 --> 00:11:45.035
Well then! The stage is going to move!

00:11:56.175 --> 00:11:58.705
Orihime and Kengyu are fated to meet.

00:11:59.745 --> 00:12:02.585
But only on the 7th night of
the 7th month once a year.

00:12:06.785 --> 00:12:09.055
Rena, wait for me.

00:12:09.325 --> 00:12:11.225
I'm not letting you win!

00:12:12.425 --> 00:12:14.295
Rare item. Rare item.

00:12:15.595 --> 00:12:16.295
I'm itching to go.

00:12:16.765 --> 00:12:18.065
Are you simply watching?

00:12:18.505 --> 00:12:20.525
A master is like that.

00:12:21.435 --> 00:12:22.565
I see.

00:12:23.005 --> 00:12:26.375
Shugo, if trained, might
improve even more.

00:12:26.805 --> 00:12:27.395
Now!

00:12:27.475 --> 00:12:28.635
Crossing the River of Heaven...

00:12:28.945 --> 00:12:31.105
...strive towards the side
of your beloved Orihime.

00:12:35.755 --> 00:12:36.945
Start!

00:12:37.855 --> 00:12:38.875
Rena!

00:12:56.105 --> 00:12:58.165
The lake gets deeper in the middle.

00:12:58.405 --> 00:12:59.235
Please be careful.

00:13:00.845 --> 00:13:02.505
You should have said so sooner!

00:13:02.575 --> 00:13:04.705
You're so clumsy, Kunisaki.

00:13:05.245 --> 00:13:06.875
No fair!

00:13:07.185 --> 00:13:10.205
There's no rule against
riding a Grunty!

00:13:12.085 --> 00:13:14.525
Go, my beloved mount, Oscar!

00:13:15.125 --> 00:13:16.555
Andre!!!

00:13:17.025 --> 00:13:19.895
Damn! I'm not letting
that guy get Rena!

00:13:20.225 --> 00:13:23.925
Sorry Shugo, I'm going to win!

00:13:24.035 --> 00:13:25.195
Outta the way!

00:13:37.975 --> 00:13:40.175
And now, Ice Storm!

00:13:45.525 --> 00:13:46.645
Ice!

00:13:46.785 --> 00:13:50.745
Yahooo! Rare item, ice skates!

00:13:55.495 --> 00:13:56.425
What a relief!

00:13:57.065 --> 00:13:57.565
Mireille!

00:13:57.565 --> 00:13:57.695
This is a cinch.
Mireille!

00:13:57.695 --> 00:13:59.035
This is a cinch.

00:13:59.765 --> 00:14:00.395
How naive!

00:14:09.545 --> 00:14:11.945
Nothing personal, Mireille!

00:14:12.215 --> 00:14:13.515
Go, Oscar!

00:14:15.115 --> 00:14:15.715
Help me!

00:14:15.715 --> 00:14:16.615
Wait!
Help me!

00:14:16.615 --> 00:14:17.815
Help me!

00:14:18.725 --> 00:14:20.685
Hotaru! What's wrong?!

00:14:21.055 --> 00:14:23.025
I can't swim.

00:14:23.125 --> 00:14:24.285
What!

00:14:24.925 --> 00:14:28.765
I thought that I could cross.

00:14:33.665 --> 00:14:35.365
Oh my, for some reason one of...

00:14:35.435 --> 00:14:37.265
...the players has turned around.

00:14:37.605 --> 00:14:38.735
Shugo!

00:14:40.005 --> 00:14:41.705
In front are Mireille and Ohka!

00:14:41.975 --> 00:14:45.605
But coming up from behind
is Komiyan the Third!

00:14:46.215 --> 00:14:47.685
Don't get in my way, Ohka!

00:14:47.845 --> 00:14:49.575
Don't you get in my way either!

00:14:49.855 --> 00:14:51.015
What!

00:14:52.885 --> 00:14:54.875
This is truly profiting
while others fight.

00:14:54.925 --> 00:14:57.555
Rena's socks are mine!

00:14:57.695 --> 00:15:00.325
And Komiyan the Third
now takes the lead!

00:15:01.295 --> 00:15:03.455
The others are behind
him by a sizable margin.

00:15:03.735 --> 00:15:06.255
Will the winner indeed
be Komiyan the Third?

00:15:06.365 --> 00:15:08.565
What?! He's in the lead?

00:15:09.435 --> 00:15:11.165
I won't let HIM win!

00:15:12.075 --> 00:15:18.875
Rena! Rena! Rena!

00:15:22.685 --> 00:15:24.815
But it won't be that
simple to reach the goal!

00:15:24.815 --> 00:15:27.215
It's time for the monster to appear!

00:15:32.995 --> 00:15:35.185
A special monster for the event!

00:15:35.235 --> 00:15:37.965
If we kill it, there's got
to be some rare item!

00:15:38.035 --> 00:15:40.335
A high-level special event monster!

00:15:40.635 --> 00:15:42.605
That's a worthy foe!

00:15:42.875 --> 00:15:44.365
Attack!

00:15:53.985 --> 00:15:55.845
Vak Don!!!

00:16:04.195 --> 00:16:06.125
What! No damage?!

00:16:06.265 --> 00:16:07.125
No way!

00:16:08.525 --> 00:16:08.925
Eh?

00:16:09.635 --> 00:16:10.755
Why?!

00:16:12.035 --> 00:16:13.125
It can't be!

00:16:13.205 --> 00:16:14.795
The same guys as before?

00:16:20.975 --> 00:16:21.805
Shugo!

00:16:23.015 --> 00:16:24.445
Sanjuro!

00:16:24.975 --> 00:16:26.605
Don't let your guard down, Shugo.

00:16:28.855 --> 00:16:29.505
That's...

00:16:31.485 --> 00:16:32.455
Lord Balmung!

00:16:33.625 --> 00:16:35.415
Ion Strike.

00:17:00.145 --> 00:17:00.675
I knew it.

00:17:04.085 --> 00:17:05.245
No!

00:17:06.785 --> 00:17:07.225
Rena!

00:17:07.625 --> 00:17:11.185
Shugo, only you can defeat it.

00:17:16.535 --> 00:17:18.025
Taking this opportunity...

00:17:24.905 --> 00:17:25.935
Nooo!

00:17:29.375 --> 00:17:31.105
Save me, Shugo!

00:17:31.945 --> 00:17:34.005
Rena!

00:17:35.655 --> 00:17:40.455
Data Drain!

00:17:52.365 --> 00:17:53.805
We did it!

00:17:53.905 --> 00:17:55.765
That was great, Shugo.

00:18:00.905 --> 00:18:03.435
Got the Rare Item!

00:18:07.245 --> 00:18:08.875
Reki, good work!

00:18:09.155 --> 00:18:09.515
Rena!

00:18:11.855 --> 00:18:13.085
Rena! Are you all right?

00:18:16.995 --> 00:18:17.455
Rena!

00:18:22.365 --> 00:18:23.485
Lord Balmung...

00:18:23.695 --> 00:18:26.225
...thank you for saving me...

00:18:26.605 --> 00:18:28.095
...from danger just now.

00:18:28.265 --> 00:18:28.965
No way.

00:18:30.375 --> 00:18:34.005
Congratulations, the
winner is Balmung!

00:18:34.475 --> 00:18:35.535
What?

00:18:35.615 --> 00:18:37.235
What is the meaning of this, Reki?

00:18:37.775 --> 00:18:39.875
Did you not say don't stop...

00:18:40.185 --> 00:18:42.585
...this event no matter
what, Lord Balmung.

00:18:43.015 --> 00:18:44.785
So the race was still going?

00:18:44.955 --> 00:18:46.885
Now! Before we award the prize...

00:18:47.225 --> 00:18:48.585
...the winner, Lord Balmung...

00:18:48.795 --> 00:18:50.225
...will receive a kiss from Orihime.

00:18:50.695 --> 00:18:51.525
What?

00:18:51.655 --> 00:18:52.595
Reki!

00:18:52.595 --> 00:18:53.455
What was that?!

00:18:54.165 --> 00:18:54.995
I'm simply following...

00:18:55.195 --> 00:18:58.635
...the rules that Lord Balmung made.

00:19:01.935 --> 00:19:02.695
Well, come on.

00:19:09.115 --> 00:19:12.405
Oh! It's a photo finish.

00:19:12.645 --> 00:19:14.445
Here's the shot at the finish line.

00:19:18.655 --> 00:19:19.445
Ah!

00:19:19.485 --> 00:19:22.255
Shugo's ahead by point one seconds!

00:19:22.395 --> 00:19:23.725
Shugo is the winner!

00:19:24.325 --> 00:19:25.385
Me?

00:19:27.125 --> 00:19:28.155
Well then...

00:19:28.225 --> 00:19:30.525
...this is a present from
Orihime to the winner.

00:19:30.935 --> 00:19:31.395
Eh?

00:19:33.005 --> 00:19:34.365
Come on now, quickly.

00:19:34.735 --> 00:19:36.665
But, we're siblings.

00:19:36.705 --> 00:19:39.035
It doesn't matter, come now, quickly!

00:19:41.345 --> 00:19:42.835
Don't hold back!

00:19:44.475 --> 00:19:46.035
Switch with me!

00:19:48.585 --> 00:19:50.145
W-What should I do?

00:19:51.255 --> 00:19:52.945
I-It can't be helped.

00:20:31.695 --> 00:20:34.325
There was no forecast for rain.

00:20:35.325 --> 00:20:35.925
It can't be.

00:20:36.395 --> 00:20:38.595
